Comment: 0,0:00:28.68,0:00:33.92,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,Mettendo insieme i nostri sogni
Comment: 0,0:00:34.14,0:00:39.75,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,andremo in cerca dei nostri desideri
Comment: 0,0:00:40.07,0:00:40.97,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,One Piece!
Comment: 0,0:00:46.19,0:00:51.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,Le bussole causano solo ritardi
Comment: 0,0:00:51.88,0:00:56.79,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,Pieno di entusiasmo, prendo il timone
Comment: 0,0:00:57.62,0:01:02.82,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,Anche la polverosa mappa del tesoro,
Comment: 0,0:01:02.82,0:01:08.07,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,se accertata, non è leggenda!
Comment: 0,0:01:09.69,0:01:15.16,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,Per le tempeste personali,
Comment: 0,0:01:15.48,0:01:20.49,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,basta sincronizzarsi sul bioritmo di un altro
Comment: 0,0:01:20.67,0:01:22.51,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,e far finta che non esistano!
Comment: 0,0:01:24.39,0:01:29.71,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,Mettendo insieme i nostri sogni
